msgstr ""
"The Method section of the article draft: who was excluded and why, the quality of the "
"administration, the description of the sample, and the Participants, Instruments and Analyses "
"paragraphs. The numbers come from the database, with the decisions in force; nothing is sent "
"outside the computer."

msgid "La signification du seuil est obligatoire."
msgstr "The meaning of the threshold is required."

msgid "La taille d'échantillon tient en 2 000 caractères au plus."
msgstr "The sample size takes 2,000 characters at most."

